WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.734 --> 00:00:16.213
Bello: Tina, why did you do that?

2
00:00:16.214 --> 00:00:19.186
Tina: Trust me, I know what I'm doing.

3
00:00:19.187 --> 00:00:20.903
Bello: I hope so.

4
00:00:20.904 --> 00:00:23.866
Tina: Bello, do you know how to jump rope?

5
00:00:23.867 --> 00:00:28.397
Bello: Sure. Back in Ginormous, I was good at it. Why?

6
00:00:28.398 --> 00:00:32.806
Tina: Watch me.

7
00:00:32.807 --> 00:00:37.066
Bello: I can do that!

8
00:00:37.067 --> 00:00:46.626
Tina: Now we can untie these knots!

9
00:00:46.627 --> 00:00:49.889
Tina: Okay. Now we can save the boys!

10
00:00:49.890 --> 00:00:52.783
Bello: All the mites are going inside the tower.

11
00:00:52.784 --> 00:00:55.871
Bello: We need to lock the door so they can't get out.

12
00:00:55.872 --> 00:01:05.439
Tina: And we need to find a way to get the boys down!

13
00:01:05.440 --> 00:01:08.925
Bello: We can use this to block the door from the outside.

14
00:01:08.926 --> 00:01:14.163
Tina: Bello, that's a great idea.

15
00:01:14.164 --> 00:01:18.631
Bello: Let's go!

16
00:01:18.632 --> 00:01:21.076
Tina: Okay. They're all in.

17
00:01:21.077 --> 00:01:27.130
Bello: Help me.

18
00:01:27.131 --> 00:01:29.110
Tina: Great.

19
00:01:29.111 --> 00:01:33.179
Bello: Now we need to get Danny and Brad out of the tower.

20
00:01:33.180 --> 00:01:37.674
Tina: If we can find something to catch them with, then they can jump.

21
00:01:37.675 --> 00:01:41.227
Bello: I'm strong! I can catch them.

22
00:01:41.228 --> 00:01:43.319
Tina: I know you're strong, Bello.

23
00:01:43.320 --> 00:01:46.527
But you're not as big as you used to be.

24
00:01:46.528 --> 00:01:54.358
Tina: We need something we can both hold, like a net.

25
00:01:54.359 --> 00:01:56.135
Tina: What about those?

26
00:01:56.136 --> 00:01:59.004
They look like they are made from spider web.

27
00:01:59.005 --> 00:02:00.411
Bello: They might work.

28
00:02:00.412 --> 00:02:02.807
We could combine two together.

29
00:02:02.808 --> 00:02:07.125
Tina: We could tie them together with the rope [n3@the mites used to tie our hands!

30
00:02:07.126 --> 00:02:14.322
Bello: Perfect!

31
00:02:14.323 --> 00:02:17.223
Danny: I'm so angry at Tina!

32
00:02:17.224 --> 00:02:20.747
Brad: Danny, we can't hold these mites back much longer.

33
00:02:20.748 --> 00:02:24.854
Brad: Maybe . . . maybe we should just admit defeat.

34
00:02:24.855 --> 00:02:28.439
Danny: And let them capture us?

35
00:02:28.440 --> 00:02:31.469
Bello: Danny, Brad! Come to the window.

36
00:02:31.470 --> 00:02:33.698
Tina: It's safe to jump.

37
00:02:33.699 --> 00:02:35.803
Brad: That's Tina's voice!

38
00:02:35.804 --> 00:02:38.588
She is saying we should jump.

39
00:02:38.589 --> 00:02:42.143
Danny: Tina! She's the reason we are trapped up here.

40
00:02:42.144 --> 00:02:43.820
Can we trust her?

41
00:02:43.821 --> 00:02:44.884
Brad: I don't know.

42
00:02:44.885 --> 00:02:47.265
But we can't hold this door any longer.

43
00:02:47.266 --> 00:02:52.319
Brad: I don't think we have any choice.

44
00:02:52.320 --> 00:02:53.814
Brad: Danny!

45
00:02:53.815 --> 00:02:56.416
Danny: Okay. We'll let go together.

46
00:02:56.417 --> 00:03:04.919
Brad: One . . . two . . . three!

47
00:03:04.920 --> 00:03:08.593
Tina: Jump! Brad, Danny, jump!

48
00:03:08.594 --> 00:03:14.066
Danny: It's a long way down.

49
00:03:14.067 --> 00:03:16.359
Brad: It's now or never!

50
00:03:16.360 --> 00:03:21.996
Danny: Catch us!
